{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"System","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sendable","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"System is a fundomental part of ECS paradigm.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Use systems to implement any behavior or logic that updates entities every frame,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"such as different types of objects or characters. For example, a physics simulation system calculates and applies the affect of gravity, forces, and collisions for all entities.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A complex game or experience may consist of many systems which need to be executed in a specific order.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The dependencies property defines when the update method for each system is called each frame. Update order is defined between system types and not between individual system instances.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Like example, let’s create a movement system:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["@PlainSystem","struct MovementSystem {","","    \/\/ Configure the query to world.","    \/\/ We want to recieve entities with `PlayerComponent` and `Transform`","    @FilterQuery<Ref<Transform>, With<PlayerComponent>>","    private var query","","    @Res<Input>","    private var input","","    init(world: World) {}","","    func update(context: UpdateContext) {","        self.query.forEach { transform in","            if input.isKeyPressed(.space) {","                \/\/ Add 5 points for vertical direction","                \/\/ if space button pressed","                transform.position.y += 5","            }","        }","    }","}",""],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System\/init(world:)"],"title":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System\/queries","doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System\/systemDependencies","doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System\/systemIdentifier"],"title":"Instance Properties"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System\/update(context:)"],"title":"Instance Methods"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Aliases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System\/UpdateContext"],"title":"Type Aliases"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System\/dependencies"],"title":"Type Properties"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"System","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"AdaECS"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Protocol","symbolKind":"protocol","externalID":"s:6AdaECS6SystemP","title":"System","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"System","kind":"identifier"}]},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"inheritsFrom","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/AdaECS\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Inherits From","kind":"relationships"},{"type":"conformingTypes","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/DefaultSchedulerRunner","doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/EventsUpdateSystem"],"title":"Conforming Types","kind":"relationships"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS"]]},"abst